  "design": {
    "decision": "Break [♠]s early and lead them to draw opponents' trumps, which is the opposite of the ruffing plan and protects side-suit honors.",
    "opponent": "Shown on the first [♠] lead; opponents hold up high [♠]s to punish leads from length.",
    "rationale": "This gives Spades a second play pattern (draw trumps) next to ra-trump-x (ruff), so the archetype has a real fork. It fires on a choice of card, has no milestone, and defends side-suit builds.",
